WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.281
At Illumination Health and Home, every referral starts a two-hour clock.

2
00:00:04.281 --> 00:00:09.502
For the coordinator, that means faxed pages, missing records, and another hospital to call.

3
00:00:09.502 --> 00:00:13.764
Care Bridge brings the evidence and the next step into one place.

4
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:20.032
Here is the working app: an owner and a deadline for every referral.

5
00:00:20.032 --> 00:00:24.229
These are invented patients. Practice reviews use the organizers' answer key,

6
00:00:24.229 --> 00:00:29.321
passed through the app's checks. This recording does not show live AI extraction.

7
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.830
Open this stroke referral. The form suggests independence.

8
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.813
But page eleven says the patient cannot walk, transfer, bathe,

9
00:00:37.813 --> 00:00:40.443
dress, or toilet without hands-on help.

10
00:00:40.443 --> 00:00:45.631
The coordinator can open that exact page, instead of trusting the form alone.

11
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.694
Each flag links a rule to the original words.

12
00:00:49.694 --> 00:00:52.755
Conflicts stay visible. Missing evidence stays unknown.

13
00:00:52.755 --> 00:00:57.243
Rules that need elapsed hours remain can't tell when dates are removed.

14
00:00:57.243 --> 00:00:59.643
Only the clinical reviewer can deny.

15
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.617
Now open the referral missing records.

16
00:01:02.617 --> 00:01:07.385
The app gathers what the hospital must send or clarify into one draft.

17
00:01:07.385 --> 00:01:13.114
Follow-up reminders are ready too. Staff review and send them. Care Bridge sends nothing.

18
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:20.295
Here is the same referral card and follow-up draft in English.

19
00:01:20.295 --> 00:01:24.306
Switch to Español. The labels and follow-up template translate together.

20
00:01:24.306 --> 00:01:28.658
Evidence quotes stay original. Some practice summaries still need translation review.

21
00:01:28.658 --> 00:01:31.343
Staff check every draft before using it.

22
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.833
After staff resolve open questions, they can record acceptance.

23
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:38.749
Then the handoff drafts are ready: chart fields,

24
00:01:38.749 --> 00:01:41.630
the census row, and the site email.

25
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:45.810
The decision and who made it stay in the local log.

26
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.577
Evidence. One draft. A clear handoff.

27
00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:54.363
This local prototype connects to no real IHH systems.

28
00:01:54.363 --> 00:01:57.384
Staff must validate accuracy before a pilot.

29
00:01:57.384 --> 00:01:59.640
The goal: fewer lost referrals.
